      "en": "In those days I, Daniel, was mourning three whole weeks.",
      "ko": "그 때에 나 다니엘이 세 이레 동안을 슬퍼하며",
      "source_text_hash": "c4ae4a7b39a5ca6ad9875af306814816464580bc32797cc7cba402bcc69a0462",
      "translation_text_hash": "84e4cbe8eaba88b1ce10ef85ee1aa310d3182150c622c22f51e3d5b04e75f452",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
