      "en": "I ate no pleasant food. No meat or wine came into my mouth. I didn’t anoint myself at all, until three whole weeks were fulfilled.",
      "ko": "세 이레가 차기까지 좋은 떡을 먹지 아니하며 고기와 포도주를 입에 넣지 아니하며 또 기름을 바르지 아니하니라",
      "source_text_hash": "8037ad2c96c263ba66bf568518c8941929578cbfd94eaee659b442dc0d50b791",
      "translation_text_hash": "f1460642f717978ddcc88998d47842cb50d2b370b111b327f9a9086e866492d5",
