      "en": "Yet I heard the voice of his words. When I heard the voice of his words, then I fell into a deep sleep on my face, with my face toward the ground.",
      "ko": "내가 그 말소리를 들었는데 그 말소리를 들을 때에 내가 얼굴을 땅에 대고 깊이 잠들었었느니라",
      "source_text_hash": "b6512eb1d252d99c288c987a9eb85ec35326b57313cdb2f0223ff9ba0dec38ab",
      "translation_text_hash": "abea6185e56133336fa9cabaa7a70d00d75a02ec2e89ad3dda4cce2858c0c5f5",
