      },
      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "DAN",
          "chapter": 10,
          "verse": 17
        }
      ],
      "en": "For how can the servant of this my lord talk with this my lord? For as for me, immediately there remained no strength in me. There was no breath left in me.”",
      "ko": "내 몸에 힘이 없어졌고 호흡이 남지 아니하였사오니 내 주의 이 종이 어찌 능히 내 주로 더불어 말씀할 수 있으리이까",
      "source_text_hash": "f0b539dee1bd01ec8f10e35072579474b8a51103d8d2b71e604f229d24454461",
      "translation_text_hash": "be6bb67d2d2aaf854bc5c4e156bf3d9447a4c7c0406aa78ceaf73e6f1f484e83",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
