      "en": "Then one like the appearance of a man touched me again, and he strengthened me.",
      "ko": "또 사람의 모양 같은 것 하나가 나를 만지며 나로 강건케 하여",
      "source_text_hash": "1230949246eeff0dbc9b39a95ce8c2d2c1b2a1653ad0e28d13a159ff035ab131",
      "translation_text_hash": "fe814c48afc1794d0bf80b22394178f3dd17613abcfba84599ff1869f348f440",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
