      "en": "But I will tell you that which is inscribed in the writing of truth. There is no one who holds with me against these but Michael your prince.",
      "ko": "오직 내가 먼저 진리의 글에 기록된 것으로 네게 보이리라 나를 도와서 그들을 대적하는 자는 너희 군 미가엘 뿐이니라",
      "source_text_hash": "92feefcd9bb6943066994ef0fea6e9b8086ebf00b11f6601ce8c60b5ecbaa1fa",
      "translation_text_hash": "6788feb01d158e53a231607aaea1a35240a78ba01cc858bfac7ffc81411c4421",
